/*
This file implements a parser test suitable for fuzz testing. Given a byte
array data, it performs the following steps:

- j1 = parse(data)
- s1 = serialize(j1)
- j2 = parse(s1)
- s2 = serialize(j2)
- assert(s1 == s2)

The provided function `LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput` can be used in different fuzzer
drivers.
*/

